-- a TCP stream over IPv4
keep-alive: off
keep-alive, set: on
keep-alive, cleared: off
no-delay: off
no-delay, set: on
receive buffer: at least what was asked
send buffer: at least what was asked
hop limit: 42
a hop limit of 256: InvalidInput
a hop limit of 0: InvalidInput
hop limit, after the two refusals: 42
linger: off
linger, set: 3 s
linger, zero: 0 s
linger, cleared: off
the accepted end's no-delay: off
-- a UDP socket over IPv4
broadcast: off
broadcast, set: on
hop limit: 7
receive buffer: at least what was asked
send buffer: at least what was asked
-- a UDP socket over IPv6
broadcast: off
broadcast, set: on
hop limit: 7
receive buffer: at least what was asked
send buffer: at least what was asked
-- a Unix-domain pair
send buffer: at least what was asked
receive buffer: at least what was asked
